<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">ARUQULA - An LLM based Text2SPARQL Approach using ReAct and Knowledge Graph Exploration Utilities</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author"><span class="ltx_annotated_personname">
